@startuml architecture1-components
 title Architecture #1 - proposed components (unimplemented)
 actor "Account holder" as User
 package "One desktop application process" {
   [Swing views/presenters] as UI
   [Application services] as App
   [Access / business policies] as Policy
   [Pure domain rules] as Domain
   interface "Repository / UnitOfWork ports" as Ports
   [JDBC adapters] as Adapter
   [Credential adapter] as Credentials
   [Bootstrap] as Boot
 }
 database "Local H2 store\nRecords + receipt BLOBs\n(proposed)" as DB
 User --> UI
 UI --> App
 App --> Policy
 App --> Domain
 App --> Ports
 Adapter ..|> Ports
 Adapter --> DB
 App --> Credentials
 Boot ..> UI : composes
 Boot ..> App : composes
 Boot ..> Adapter : composes
 note bottom of Domain
 BigDecimal; explicit participants;
 pending isolation; total preservation.
 Residual / reviewer policies unresolved.
 end note
@enduml

@startuml architecture1-deployment
 title Architecture #1 - conditional local deployment (not deployed)
 node "Workstation / OS account trust boundary" {
   node "Java 21 runtime" {
     artifact "Proposed executable application JAR" as Jar
     component "Swing event dispatch thread" as EDT
     component "Background service / storage worker" as Worker
   }
   folder "Private data directory\nOutside repository / file sync" {
     database "Embedded H2 file\nIncludes receipt BLOBs" as Store
   }
 }
 EDT --> Worker : in-process calls
 Worker --> Store : JDBC transactions
 note right of Store
 No shared network file, server,
 synchronization or remote clients.
 Host file access bypasses app login.
 end note
 note bottom of Jar
 Desktop candidate does not meet CR-10.
 Web/mobile scope decision U-01 required.
 end note
@enduml
